      "writtenOn": "2017-02-03T05:46:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If it returns anything but success, do you actually want to continue?  If it is busy roaming, won\u0027t you have to re-run the selection anyway in case the new network is better than what you picked?  Given that the new network will have different stats, you don\u0027t know what you will do if it does connect.  If it is an error, then maybe you need to reload or clear all state.",
